/* 12段零工熟客/东家后续 + 6段收集信物NPC鉴看反应 = 18段 */
:: MP Job Followup Cafe [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
打烊前，常坐靠窗三号桌的老乐手特意留步，点名请你替他打包两份柠檬司康与热红茶，说是认准了你烤司康的火候。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回咖啡馆 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_cafe is 1>>
这处暗格今天已经仔细查验过，眼下并无新的动静。
<<else>>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[打包餐包 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Cafe A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[附赠蜜酱 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Cafe B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Cafe A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
你系紧吧台围裙走到老乐手桌边，准备温壶冲泡手冲咖啡。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回熟客 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="job-fup-cafe-a">
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<tendingicon>><<link "包好餐包 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-cafe-a">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_cafe to 1>>
	老乐手欣慰地接过温热餐包，在吧台木碟下压了一张整钞与一张旧音乐会书签。<span class="green">熟客对你的周到赞不绝口。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_cafe_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1350>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	系麻绳时纸袋边角裂了一道小口，你连忙换了一只新纸袋重新装好。<span class="red">匆忙打包时被热茶壶柄烫了一下手背。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Cafe A]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">包好餐包 (0:07)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Job Followup Cafe B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
你取来细嘴铜壶与绒布滤网，打算按老乐手偏爱的慢萃法细细伺候。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回熟客 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="job-fup-cafe-b">
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>><<tendingicon>><<link "附赠蜜酱 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-cafe-b">>
<<if ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or ($english or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_cafe to 1>>
		你特意取来一小盅清香的柠檬蜜酱摆在餐盒旁，酸甜果香让热餐包更显诱人。<span class="green">老乐手尝了一口蜜酱，眉眼舒展地连声夸你贴心。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_cafe_keepsake_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><span class="teal">老乐手临走前将一枚镌刻音符的古铜书签留给你作纪念。</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	取蜜酱时木勺柄滑了一下，柠檬汁滴在了托盘布上。<span class="red">你连忙换过一块干净餐巾，手背被热水壶烘得发烫。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<investigateicon>><<link [[擦净指腹重按簧片 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Cafe B]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Cafe]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">附赠蜜酱 (0:07)（应对不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
:: MP Job Followup Fish [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
梅尔街酒馆的采买厨师一早赶到栈桥，越过别的摊位直奔你面前，说只有你剔过刺的银鳕鱼柳最合酒馆贵客的口味。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回鱼档 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_fish is 1>>
今日的事宜已料理妥当，无需在此处重复费神。
<<else>>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[片出鱼柳 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Fish A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[铺冰码齐 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Fish B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Fish A [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
你挽起防水袖套走到采买厨师跟前，准备下刀分切整条银鳕。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回熟客 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<div id="job-fup-fish-a">
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<tendingicon>><<link "片出鱼柳 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#job-fup-fish-a">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_fish to 1>>
	采买厨师拎起竹篓满意离去，老渔夫笑着把酒馆多付的加急刀工钱全塞给了你。<span class="green">你的熟练刀工赢得了酒馆长期订货。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_fish_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1350>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	刀尖在鱼骨上滑了一下，虽然没伤到手，却切碎了一片鱼腹肉。<span class="red">冰水浸得手指发僵，刀路略显滞涩。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Fish A]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">片出鱼柳 (0:07)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

:: MP Job Followup Fish B [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
你端来碎冰木盘与去骨小刀，打算按酒馆主厨讲究的刀法精细片鱼。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回熟客 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
