<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_fish to 1>>
		你按酒馆冷鲜规矩在竹篓底铺匀碎冰与湿海带，将鱼柳一层层隔开码齐。<span class="green">鱼肉锁住了鲜甜汁水，采买厨师连声称赞。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_fish_keepsake_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><span class="teal">采买厨师临别前将一枚梅尔街老酒馆的纯铜品菜牌留给你作信物。</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回班次 (0:02)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
碎冰铺得太厚顶起了竹篓盖，你重排海带时冻得指节通红。<span class="red">寒气渗入指缝，你只得先停手暖一暖。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Fish B]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身步回当班岗位 (0:03)|MP Job Fish]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">铺冰码齐 (0:07)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
