	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_clock_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1440>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	你在放大镜下盯得太久，眼睛酸涩流泪，镊子尖也碰歪了表蒙垫圈。<span class="red">长时间细看令双目酸痛不已。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
