	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Clock]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">擦净煤灰 (0:07)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

