<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回驿站 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_job_followup_courier is 1>>
手头的线索今日已经理清，再留在此处也无新发现。
<<else>>
<<tendingicon>><<link [[固定药匣 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Courier A]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[抄近道送达 (0:02)|MP Job Followup Courier B]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: MP Job Followup Courier A [nobr]
