	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_followup_courier_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1350>><</if>>
	<<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	路上为护住怀里的药匣，你避让马车时脚踝在马路牙子上崴了一下。<span class="red">药匣虽保住了，脚踝却有些酸痛。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Job Followup Courier A]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">固定药匣 (0:07)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>

