:: MP Keepsake Show Whistle [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if !($mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_foghorn_whistle"])>><<goto "MP NPC Vesper Service">><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.vesper to ($mpNpcs.vesper or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.vesper>>
你从贴身衣袋取出那枚在海蚀回音廊深处寻获的双锚纹守塔人铜哨。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>目光一凝，接过铜哨翻看内壁刻字：「这是老港务长失踪前随身带的引航哨，有了它，暗港夜航船见哨如见人。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<walkicon>><<link [[返回维斯身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">返回维斯身旁 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_whistle is 1>>
此间的器物今日已经养护过一回，先回岗位待命吧。
<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-whistle">
<<keepsakeicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240>><<link "请维斯试吹 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-whistle">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($swimmingskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_whistle to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	维斯将铜哨穿上一根涂蜡海魂绳挂回你颈间。<span class="green">维斯为你解开了铜哨的引航暗码。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_whistle_reward_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1650>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	
	海风吹晃防风灯，维斯先帮你将铜哨收好，约好等下次退潮再去核对暗礁。<span class="teal">维斯叮嘱你收紧铜哨挂绳。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[握稳工具重调位置 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">请维斯试吹 (0:06)（水性不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">请维斯试吹引航哨音暗码 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link "摹下暗礁航线 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-whistle">>
<<if ($history or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_whistle to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你与维斯并肩凑在防风灯下，将铜哨内壁镌刻的潮汐折线与私港古海图逐一比对。<span class="green">隐藏在暗礁群后的归航盲道被你们彻底核对清楚。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_whistle_reward_keepsake_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回原处 (0:02)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	铜哨内壁的微雕细如发丝，船舱马灯晃动间你看得眼眶发酸也没能对齐刻度。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.vesper and $mpNpcs.vesper.hasMet>>维斯<<else>>夜航船长<</if>>体贴地替你合上海图，让你先喝口热茶歇歇眼睛。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[压住台面重新着力 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Whistle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回交谈处 (0:03)|MP NPC Vesper Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">摹下暗礁航线 (0:06)（应对不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
