	塞拉小心地替游丝芯配好防磁水晶外盒交还给你。<span class="green">塞拉替你将机括母芯保养得完好如初。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_core_reward_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1650>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	
