	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[垫上干布重起卡扣 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Core]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[收妥行囊回交谈处 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">请塞拉测算 (0:06)（技艺不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">请塞拉测算母芯的摆频齿数 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
