	<<link [[返回原处 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
镊子尖端在防磁盒边沿轻轻磕了一下，惊得你屏住呼吸。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.sera and $mpNpcs.sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>连忙接手稳住表芯，让你先歇口气。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
