<<if !($mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_blackiron_medal"])>><<goto "MP NPC Lin Service">><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.lin to ($mpNpcs.lin or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.lin>>
你把黑铁货运站底舱找到的站长纪念铜章递给<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>摩挲着铜章背面的齿轮锤纹，眼神微震：「这是当年带头抵制黑货的老师傅留下的徽记，货运站的老工人全都认它。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<walkicon>><<link [[返回林恩身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">返回林恩身旁 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_medal is 1>>
今日与对方的交接已经办妥，不必再上前打扰。
<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-medal">
<<keepsakeicon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>><<link "拓下班组编号 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-medal">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 420>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_medal to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	林恩替铜章换上结实的皮挂绳交还给你。<span class="green">站长纪念铜章赢得了工友们的敬重。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_medal_reward_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1650>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	
	巷口吹来冷风，林恩替你把铜章擦净塞回衣兜。<span class="teal">林恩说下次带你去认认老工友。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[借着侧光重对刻痕 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Medal]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">拓下班组编号 (0:06)（手法不足）</span><</if>><<else>><span class="disabled">与林恩拓下铜面的班组编号 (0:06)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link "打磨铜章 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-medal">>
<<if ($physique or 10000) gte 11400 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_medal to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你裁下一小块极细的金相砂纸，顺着站长纪念铜章的齿轮浮雕纹理轻轻打磨掉陈年绿锈。<span class="green">铜章背面的工号与星火铭文重现灿然金光，林恩看得赞叹不已。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_medal_reward_keepsake_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得未鉴定古董 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回原处 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	凹槽深处的铜绿结得颇硬，砂纸边缘折了一下刮在你的指甲盖上。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜人<</if>>连忙握住你的手吹了吹，接过砂纸替你收尾。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[扣紧边沿重新提拉 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Medal]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[整好衣领回交谈处 (0:03)|MP NPC Lin Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">打磨铜章 (0:06)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Keepsake Show Antler [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "cafe">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>>
<<if !($mpKeepsake and $mpKeepsake["keepsake_druid_antler"])>><<goto "MP NPC Monet Service">><</if>>
<<set $mpNpcs to ($mpNpcs or {})>><<set $mpNpcs.monet to ($mpNpcs.monet or { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0 })>><<set _npc to $mpNpcs.monet>>
你取出深林古石环寻获的白鹿角坠饰请<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>鉴看。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>指尖轻抚过鹿角上流畅的螺旋浮雕，眼底满是惊叹：「多美的古凯尔特刀工，这纹样正好能做我们下一季高定胸针的母模！」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>><<walkicon>><<link [[返回莫奈身旁 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">返回莫奈身旁 (0:02)（尚未结识）</span><</if>>
<br>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_antler is 1>>
现场痕迹已被你抚平，今天无需再多生枝节。
<<else>>
<div id="ks-show-antler">
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>><<keepsakeicon>><<link "拓下纹样 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-antler">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_antler to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	莫奈替白鹿角坠饰系上华美的暗金丝穗还给你。<span class="green">白鹿角坠饰化作了精美的随身佩饰。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_antler_reward_money_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 1650>><</if>>
	<<stress -4>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	
	画室烛火摇晃，莫奈先用丝帕替你把白鹿角坠饰包好。<span class="teal">莫奈约你改日白昼再来拓印纹样。</span><<stress -1>>
	<br><br>
	<<runicon>><<link [[理顺纹理重压边缘 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Antler]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[转身步回交谈处 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">拓下纹样 (0:06)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>><<link "银丝编挂穗 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#ks-show-antler">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpJobKs_mp_keepsake_show_antler to 1>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>><<set _npc.trust to Math.min(100, (_npc.trust or 0) + 2)>>
	你拈起暗金与银白双色丝线，配合莫奈灵巧的编织手法为白鹿角坠饰挽出一道同心挂穗。<span class="green">银丝挂穗衬得温润鹿角愈发灵动，莫奈笑着将它系在你衣襟前。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("keepsake_show_antler_reward_keepsake_" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>><span class="blue">获得草药 ×1</span><</if>>
	<<tiredness -1>><<stress -3>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[返回原处 (0:02)|MP NPC Monet Service]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<set _npc.love to Math.min(100, (_npc.love or 0) + 1)>>
	金银细丝在指间缠绕时打了个小滑结，你挑解线头时不小心勾乱了流苏尾端。<span class="red"><<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.monet and $mpNpcs.monet.hasMet>>莫奈<<else>>画师<</if>>笑着按住你的手背，教你顺着丝线捻向慢慢理开。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[踩稳落脚重新探手 (0:04)|MP Keepsake Show Antler]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[缓步走回交谈处 (0:03)|MP NPC Monet Service]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<<else>><span class="disabled">银丝编挂穗 (0:06)（技艺不足）</span><</if>>
</div>
<</if>>
